[size=5][b][color=#b78ae8]AI-Generated Content — Full Disclosure[/color][/b][/size]
Parts of this mod were produced with AI assistance. In the interest of transparency:
[list]
[*][b]Item icons[/b] (ore, ingot): generated with OpenAI image generation (gpt-image-1), then cropped, scaled and cleaned up by hand.
[*][b]Block texture[/b] (diffuse and normal maps): generated procedurally by a Python script; the script was written by an AI assistant (Anthropic's Claude), not hand-painted.
[*][b]Code, XML configuration and the 13 translations[/b]: written with the help of Claude, reviewed before release.
[/list]
The mod design, testing and final decisions are the author's.

[size=5][b][color=#b78ae8]Credits[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Harmony by Andreas Pardeike.
[/list]

